# Clan Berne: "Fall of Merta" (VA_VampCountess). Raxle Berne takes the player's service again ("serve me") and names
# a renegade ("an errand for you": 10, "I will kill her for you." 1: 20). In the Reloth Ancestral Tomb Merta smells
# Berne blood and attacks (mertaScript); her death logs 40, and Raxle rewards the player with his amulet ("Merta": 50).
# Kills of twelve Aundae or Quarra vampires while the quest stands at 50 (Vampire_Aundae counts VampKills on death)
# earn the clan's last reward ("future rewards": 60).
# The kills stand in for the fights; `approach` stands in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_berne_countess_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_berne_countess_start
approach 0537C5DE
talk raxle berne
ask serve me
ask an errand for you
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCountess == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCountess == 20
bye
end

case va_berne_countess_merta
approach 05738EDD
wait 60
bye if open
defend
console 05738EDD.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex VA_VampCountess == 40
approach 0537C5DE
talk raxle berne
ask Merta
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCountess == 50
expect player->GetItemCount "amulet_berne" == 1
bye
end

case va_berne_rewards
approach 053E1E58
console 053E1E58.kill
wait 60
approach 052D64B1
console 052D64B1.kill
wait 60
approach 053C5D68
console 053C5D68.kill
wait 60
approach 05826ECA
console 05826ECA.kill
wait 60
approach 05BE5476
console 05BE5476.kill
wait 60
approach 057AF45F
console 057AF45F.kill
wait 60
approach 053E90AA
console 053E90AA.kill
wait 60
approach 05DAF1FD
console 05DAF1FD.kill
wait 60
approach 05588CCD
console 05588CCD.kill
wait 60
approach 05D63F0E
console 05D63F0E.kill
wait 60
approach 05572B34
console 05572B34.kill
wait 60
approach 05DC6EA3
console 05DC6EA3.kill
wait 60
expect VampKills >= 12
approach 0537C5DE
talk raxle berne
ask future rewards
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCountess == 60
bye
end
